{"channelId":"UCaL8cOpwsihR_mF8XmQPtMQ","row":["Equine Voices Rescue & Sanctuary",538,"Nestled in the foothills of the Santa Rita Mountains in Southern Arizona, Jumpin' Jack Ranch is home to Equine Voices Rescue & Sanctuary. \nEquine Voices Rescue & Sanctuary is a 501 (c)(3) non-profit organization whose mission is to rescue equines from neglect, abuse, abandonment and slaughter. Additionally, we rehabilitate, adopt and/or provide a safe and loving sanctuary to those equines who need a forever home. Through education, we empower individuals to learn about Premarin and horse slaughter.\n\nVisit our Website at equinevoices.org","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaL8cOpwsihR_mF8XmQPtMQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaL8cOpwsihR_mF8XmQPtMQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:31.100Z","channelId":"UCaL8cOpwsihR_mF8XmQPtMQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"0612d60f3662d7de36f1fdf0a230c1ffa6f73b4603be1cf4ff0081cb56e366eb","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"561a11e93a08bacab96fe6ad33030441611d57d5e32ae386b5f1926cd8a10893"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaL8cOpwsihR_mF8XmQPtMQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":538,"raw":"538 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCaL8cOpwsihR_mF8XmQPtMQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:10:31.100Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":false,"evidenceLevel":"unconfirmed","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":[]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人与目标人群的关系；保留原记录，不猜测身份。","keywords":[],"role":"undetermined","excerpt":"Nestled in the foothills of the Santa Rita Mountains in Southern Arizona, Jumpin' Jack Ranch is home to Equine Voices Rescue & Sanctuary. Equine Voices Rescue & Sanctuary is a 501